  "dataSourceInstructions": "1. Purpose\nThis data source contains trial balance records used for financial analysis across multiple organizational dimensions.\n\n2. Key Table\ntrial_balance_mapping: Stores detailed trial balance entries by period and across various financial and organizational dimensions.\n\n3. Key Columns\nThe agent should understand and utilize the following columns for querying and filtering:\n\nLedger_Name, UniqueCodeKey\nEntity_Code, Entity_Name\nBusiness_Line_Code, Business_Line_Name\nCost_Center_Code, Cost_Center_Name\nProject_Code, Project_Name\nIntercompany_Code, Intercompany_Name\nAccount_Code, Account_Name, Account_Grouping\nAnalytical_Code, Analytical_Code_Name\nRegion_Code, Region_Name\nPeriod_Name, Currency_Code\nOpening_Balance, Total_Debit, Total_Credit, Closing_Balance\nOpening_Balance_SAR, Total_Debit_SAR, Total_Credit_SAR, Closing_Balance_SAR\nFS_Category\n\n4. Column Relationships\nAccount_Name is a subset of Account_Grouping.\nAccount_Grouping is a subset of FS_Category.\nAnalytical_Code_Name is a subset of Account_Name.",
